---
description: Prefer Nushell built-ins in Nushell scripts
globs: "**/*.nu"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Nushell built-ins

- Prefer Nushell built-in commands over external commands when they provide the required behavior.
- Use external commands only when no equivalent built-in exists or the external tool provides a required capability.
- Preserve structured Nushell data rather than parsing text output unnecessarily.

```nu
# Prefer
http get $url

# Avoid when an equivalent built-in exists
^curl $url
```
